
Production-Grade Multi-Stage CI/CD Pipeline with Automated AWS Deployments and Real-Time Observability





📋 Project Overview

This repository houses an automated, secure, and production-ready End-to-End DevOps CI/CD Pipeline. Built using GitHub Actions, Docker, and Amazon Web Services (AWS), the system enforces strict code quality gates, builds immutable artifacts, and executes zero-downtime, self-healing deployments on AWS EC2 instances.
To bridge the gap between deployment and operations, the infrastructure features an integrated CloudWatch Auto-Update Tool that dynamically provisions dashboards, manages host-level metric agents, and handles log stream synchronization upon container refreshes.

